                "description": "Velocity–time graph with the printed 1–12 second ticks, 10–60 velocity ticks and a light major grid. The source blue series is represented with standard booklet blue.",
                "mathematics": "v=50(1-e^{-0.5t}) for t≥0. The plot begins at the origin, increases with decreasing gradient and approaches 50 from below. Major grid increments are 1 second and 10 m/s.",
                "answerVisibility": "Solution only."
